formatting examples for .rdr files:

planes:
 ______________________ aircraft
|     _________________ X departure value
|    |     ____________ Y departure value
|    |    |     _______ X vector ____ in km/h
|    |    |    |     __ Y vector _/
v    v    v    v    v
A  1080  720  500  700

towers:
 _________________ tower
|     ____________ X position
|    |     _______ Y position
|    |    |     __ radius in km (display in nm)
v    v    v    v
T   400  300  5000
